WEBVTT

00:01:30.493 --> 00:01:33.538
You boys really screwed up this time.

00:01:37.254 --> 00:01:38.591
Where is he?

00:01:40.466 --> 00:01:42.607
You're never gonna
see your father again.

00:01:45.418 --> 00:01:48.230
They've got dad.

00:01:48.264 --> 00:01:49.602
Meg?

00:01:50.841 --> 00:01:52.012
What did she say?

00:01:52.046 --> 00:01:53.751
I just told you, sammy.

00:01:55.124 --> 00:01:59.575
Okay.

00:02:04.562 --> 00:02:06.703
What are you doing, dean?

00:02:06.737 --> 00:02:08.913
We got to go.

00:02:08.946 --> 00:02:10.921
Why?

00:02:10.954 --> 00:02:13.096
Because the demon knows
we're in salvation.

00:02:13.130 --> 00:02:14.735
It knows we've got the colt.

00:02:14.769 --> 00:02:16.410
It's probably coming for us next.

00:02:16.442 --> 00:02:18.583
We've still got three bullets left.

00:02:18.618 --> 00:02:20.392
Listen, tough guy, we're not ready.

00:02:20.426 --> 00:02:22.599
We don't know how many
of them are out there.

00:02:22.634 --> 00:02:24.775
We're no good to anybody dead.

00:02:24.809 --> 00:02:27.386
We're leaving...now.

00:02:34.647 --> 00:02:38.563
I'm telling you, dean,
we could've taken him.

00:02:38.597 --> 00:02:40.037
What we need is a plan.

00:02:40.070 --> 00:02:42.579
They're keeping dad alive.
We've got to figure out where.

00:02:42.613 --> 00:02:45.258
They're gonna want to
trade him for the gun.

00:02:45.291 --> 00:02:47.566
What?

00:02:47.599 --> 00:02:50.378
If that were true, why
didn't meg mention a trade?

00:02:52.453 --> 00:02:55.498
Dad, he might be -

00:02:55.532 --> 00:02:57.673
I don't want to believe
it any more than you,

00:02:57.706 --> 00:03:01.489
But if he is, all the more
reason to kill this damn thing.

00:03:01.522 --> 00:03:03.965
We still have the colt. We
can still finish the job.

00:03:03.998 --> 00:03:05.170
Screw the job, sam!

00:03:05.203 --> 00:03:07.346
Dean, i'm just trying
to do what he would want.

00:03:07.379 --> 00:03:11.194
Would you quit talking about
him like he's dead already?

00:03:11.227 --> 00:03:12.366
Listen to me.

00:03:12.399 --> 00:03:14.875
Everything stops until we get him back.

00:03:14.909 --> 00:03:16.214
Everything.

00:03:20.130 --> 00:03:21.435
So, how do we find him?

00:03:21.468 --> 00:03:22.773
Maybe we go to lincoln.

00:03:22.806 --> 00:03:25.049
Start at the warehouse
where he was taken.

00:03:25.082 --> 00:03:27.492
You really think these demons
are gonna leave a trail?

00:03:27.526 --> 00:03:29.702
You're right.

00:03:31.039 --> 00:03:33.249
We need help.

00:03:59.118 --> 00:04:01.126
Here you go.

00:04:03.201 --> 00:04:04.842
What is this
- Holy water?

00:04:04.874 --> 00:04:07.217
That one is. This is whiskey.

00:04:13.241 --> 00:04:16.521
Bobby, thanks. Thanks for everything.

00:04:16.554 --> 00:04:19.030
To tell you the truth, i
wasn't sure if we should come.

00:04:19.063 --> 00:04:20.872
Nonsense. Your daddy needs help.

00:04:20.906 --> 00:04:22.075
The last time we saw you,

00:04:22.110 --> 00:04:24.285
You did threaten to blast
him full of buckshot.

00:04:24.318 --> 00:04:26.126
You cocked the shotgun and everything.

00:04:26.159 --> 00:04:28.970
Yeah, well, what can i say?

00:04:29.003 --> 00:04:31.045
John just has that effect on people.

00:04:31.078 --> 00:04:33.622
Yeah, i guess he does.

00:04:33.656 --> 00:04:34.962
None of that matters now.

00:04:34.994 --> 00:04:37.638
All that matters is
that you get him back.

00:04:37.672 --> 00:04:39.814
Bobby, this book.

00:04:39.847 --> 00:04:42.155
I've never seen anything like it.

00:04:42.190 --> 00:04:46.842
Key of solomon? It's
the real deal, all right.

00:04:46.875 --> 00:04:50.054
And these protective circles
- They really work?

00:04:50.087 --> 00:04:51.125
Hell yeah.

00:04:51.158 --> 00:04:54.706
You get a demon in one, they're trapped.

00:04:54.740 --> 00:04:58.689
They're powerless. It's
like a satanic roach motel.

00:04:58.722 --> 00:05:00.194
Dean: the man knows his stuff.

00:05:00.227 --> 00:05:04.210
I'll tell you something else, too.

00:05:04.243 --> 00:05:07.725
This is some serious
crap you boys stepped in.

00:05:07.758 --> 00:05:11.238
Oh, yeah? How's that?

00:05:11.271 --> 00:05:15.455
Normal year, i hear, say,
three demonic possessions,

00:05:15.489 --> 00:05:17.497
Maybe four, tops.

00:05:17.530 --> 00:05:20.944
This year, i heard of 27 so far.

00:05:20.978 --> 00:05:22.517
You get what i'm saying?

00:05:22.550 --> 00:05:27.370
More and more demons are walking among us
- A lot more.

00:05:27.403 --> 00:05:30.281
Do you know why?

00:05:30.314 --> 00:05:32.623
No, but i know it's something big.

00:05:32.658 --> 00:05:37.811
The storm's coming, and
you boys, your daddy -

00:05:37.845 --> 00:05:40.254
You are smack in the middle of it.

00:05:44.270 --> 00:05:47.115
Rumsfeld.

00:05:47.149 --> 00:05:48.487
What is it?

00:05:53.240 --> 00:05:55.248
Something's wrong.

00:06:00.334 --> 00:06:02.878
No more crap, okay?

00:06:11.746 --> 00:06:16.733
I want the colt,
sam - The real colt -

00:06:16.766 --> 00:06:20.247
Right now.

00:06:20.281 --> 00:06:22.657
We don't have it on us. We buried it.

00:06:22.690 --> 00:06:24.196
Didn't i say "no more crap"?

00:06:24.230 --> 00:06:27.342
I swear
- After everything i heard about you winchesters,

00:06:27.376 --> 00:06:30.789
I've got to tell you,
i'm a little underwhelmed.

00:06:30.822 --> 00:06:34.002
First johnny tries to
pawn off a fake gun,

00:06:34.035 --> 00:06:37.883
And then he leaves the real
gun with you two chuckleheads.

00:06:37.918 --> 00:06:39.424
Lackluster, men.

00:06:39.458 --> 00:06:45.647
I mean, did you really
think i wouldn't find you?

00:06:49.162 --> 00:06:53.011
Actually, we were counting on it.

00:07:06.532 --> 00:07:08.639
Gotcha.

00:07:22.630 --> 00:07:27.448
You know, if you wanted to tie me up,

00:07:27.482 --> 00:07:29.658
All you had to do was ask.

00:07:32.835 --> 00:07:34.978
I salted the doors and windows.

00:07:35.011 --> 00:07:38.023
If there are any demons out
there, they ain't getting in.

00:07:45.654 --> 00:07:47.462
Where's our father, meg?

00:07:47.495 --> 00:07:50.239
You didn't ask very nice.

00:07:50.273 --> 00:07:51.811
Where's our father, bitch?

00:07:51.845 --> 00:07:55.995
Jeez. You kiss your
mother with that mouth?

00:07:56.029 --> 00:07:58.774
Oh, i forgot. You don't.

00:07:58.806 --> 00:08:01.082
You think this is a freaking game?!

00:08:01.115 --> 00:08:02.990
Where is he?! What did you do to him?!

00:08:03.023 --> 00:08:07.508
He died screaming. I killed him myself.

00:08:16.878 --> 00:08:22.099
That's kind of a turn-On
- You hitting a girl.

00:08:22.133 --> 00:08:23.739
You're no girl.

00:08:25.311 --> 00:08:27.354
Dean.

00:08:28.959 --> 00:08:30.934
You okay?

00:08:30.967 --> 00:08:32.339
She's lying. He's not dead.

00:08:32.374 --> 00:08:34.918
Dean, you've got to be careful
with her. Don't hurt her.

00:08:34.950 --> 00:08:36.658
Why?

00:08:36.691 --> 00:08:38.531
Because she really
is a girl. That's why.

00:08:38.565 --> 00:08:39.938
What are you talking about?

00:08:39.970 --> 00:08:41.107
She's possessed.

00:08:41.142 --> 00:08:43.115
That's a human possessed by a demon.

00:08:43.150 --> 00:08:45.123
Can't you tell?

00:08:45.158 --> 00:08:47.970
Are you trying to tell me
there's an innocent girl

00:08:48.002 --> 00:08:50.714
Trapped somewhere in there?

00:08:57.273 --> 00:08:59.615
That's actually good news.

00:09:11.798 --> 00:09:13.939
Are you gonna read me a story?

00:09:13.973 --> 00:09:17.687
Something like that. Hit it, sam.

00:09:17.721 --> 00:09:23.912
<i>"Regna terrae, cantTe
deo, psLlite dMino..."</i>

00:09:23.946 --> 00:09:28.096
An exorcism? Are you serious?

00:09:28.130 --> 00:09:29.970
We're going for it, baby
- Head spinning,

00:09:30.003 --> 00:09:32.614
Projectile vomiting,
the whole nine yards.

00:09:32.647 --> 00:09:35.190
<i>"Tribuite virtutem deo."</i>

00:09:41.850 --> 00:09:45.498
I'm gonna kill you.

00:09:45.531 --> 00:09:48.845
I'm gonna rip the bones from your body.

00:09:48.878 --> 00:09:51.020
No, you're gonna burn in hell

00:09:51.054 --> 00:09:53.028
Unless you tell us where our dad is.

00:09:55.337 --> 00:09:59.086
Well, at least you'll get a nice tan.

00:10:01.595 --> 00:10:05.779
<i>"Exorcizamus te, omnis
immundus spiritus,</i>

00:10:05.813 --> 00:10:09.059
<i>"Omnis satanica potestas,</i>

00:10:09.092 --> 00:10:11.937
<i>"Omnis incursio infernalis
adversarii, omnis legio,</i>

00:10:11.970 --> 00:10:14.949
<i>"Omnis congregatio et secta diabolica."</i>

00:10:14.982 --> 00:10:16.288
Aah!

00:10:17.292 --> 00:10:22.445
He begged for his life
with tears in his eyes.

00:10:22.478 --> 00:10:26.328
He begged to see his sons one last time.

00:10:26.362 --> 00:10:28.135
That's when i slit his throat.

00:10:33.891 --> 00:10:34.862
<i>"Ergo..."</i>

00:10:34.895 --> 00:10:39.045
For your sake, i hope you're lying.

00:10:39.078 --> 00:10:41.287
'Cause if it's true, i swear to god,

00:10:41.321 --> 00:10:43.262
I will march into hell myself,

00:10:43.295 --> 00:10:45.705
And i will slaughter each and every one

00:10:45.738 --> 00:10:48.416
Of you evil sons of
bitches, so help me god.

00:10:48.450 --> 00:10:51.126
<i>"Perditionis venenum propinare.</i>

00:10:51.160 --> 00:10:57.987
<i>"Vade, satana, inventor et
magister omnis fallaciae,</i>

00:10:58.021 --> 00:11:00.831
<i>"Hostis humanae salutis.</i>

00:11:00.865 --> 00:11:04.346
<i>"Humiliare sub potenti manu
dei, contremisce et effuge,</i>

00:11:04.379 --> 00:11:08.094
<i>"Invocato a nobis sancto
et terribili nomine,</i>

00:11:08.127 --> 00:11:10.202
<i>Quem inferi tremunt."</i>

00:11:10.236 --> 00:11:11.707
Aah!

00:11:11.742 --> 00:11:13.081
Where is he?

00:11:14.954 --> 00:11:17.264
You just won't take "dead"
for an answer, will you?

00:11:17.298 --> 00:11:19.105
Where is he?!

00:11:19.138 --> 00:11:20.778
Dead! No, he's not!

00:11:20.811 --> 00:11:22.718
He's not dead! He can't be!

00:11:26.199 --> 00:11:28.174
What are you looking at? Keep reading.

00:11:28.207 --> 00:11:31.354
<i>"Ab insidiis diaboli,
libera nos, domine.</i>

00:11:31.387 --> 00:11:36.909
<i>"Ut ecclesiam tuam secura
tibi facias libertate servire,</i>

00:11:36.942 --> 00:11:39.553
<i>Te rogamus, audi nos."</i>

00:11:39.586 --> 00:11:42.398
Aaaah!

00:11:42.431 --> 00:11:46.747
<i>"Ut inimicos sanctae
ecclesiae humiliare digneris,</i>

00:11:46.781 --> 00:11:48.555
<i>Te rogamus audi
-"</i>

00:11:48.589 --> 00:11:49.726
He will be!

00:11:49.759 --> 00:11:50.730
Wait! What?!

00:11:50.763 --> 00:11:52.303
He's not dead,

00:11:52.337 --> 00:11:55.583
But he will be after what we do to him.

00:11:57.190 --> 00:11:59.766
How do we know you're telling the truth?

00:11:59.799 --> 00:12:01.005
You don't.

00:12:01.038 --> 00:12:02.511
Sam! A building!

00:12:02.544 --> 00:12:05.289
Okay? A building in jefferson city.

00:12:05.322 --> 00:12:08.066
Missouri? Where, where? An address.

00:12:08.099 --> 00:12:09.203
I don't know.

00:12:09.238 --> 00:12:10.843
And the demon
- Where is it?

00:12:10.877 --> 00:12:12.551
I don't know. I swear.

00:12:14.258 --> 00:12:17.270
That's everything. That's all i know.

00:12:21.687 --> 00:12:22.958
Finish it.

00:12:22.991 --> 00:12:24.800
What? I told you the truth.

00:12:24.834 --> 00:12:26.306
I don't care.

00:12:26.339 --> 00:12:27.812
You son of a bitch. You promised.

00:12:27.846 --> 00:12:30.154
I lied!

00:12:30.187 --> 00:12:32.027
Sam?

00:12:34.170 --> 00:12:36.010
Sam!

00:12:37.818 --> 00:12:39.626
Read.

00:12:39.659 --> 00:12:42.470
We can still use her, find
out where the demon is.

00:12:42.503 --> 00:12:43.809
She doesn't know.

00:12:43.842 --> 00:12:46.519
There's an innocent girl
trapped somewhere in there.

00:12:46.553 --> 00:12:48.126
We've got to help her.

00:12:48.159 --> 00:12:49.766
You're gonna kill her.

00:12:49.799 --> 00:12:50.938
What?

00:12:50.970 --> 00:12:54.551
You said she fell from a building.

00:12:56.258 --> 00:12:58.768
That girl's body is broken.

00:12:58.802 --> 00:13:02.415
The only thing keeping her
alive is that demon inside.

00:13:02.450 --> 00:13:05.629
You exorcise it, the girl is gonna die.

00:13:05.662 --> 00:13:07.704
We are not gonna leave her like that.

00:13:07.738 --> 00:13:08.875
She is a human being.

00:13:08.909 --> 00:13:11.787
And we're gonna put
her out of her misery.

00:13:11.820 --> 00:13:14.297
Sam, finish it.

00:13:23.098 --> 00:13:25.943
Finish it.

00:13:32.938 --> 00:13:37.590
<i>"Dominicos sanctae ecclesiae.</i>

00:13:37.623 --> 00:13:39.262
<i>"Terogamus audi nos.</i>

00:13:39.295 --> 00:13:43.112
<i>"Terribilis deus de
sanctuario suo deus israhel</i>

00:13:43.146 --> 00:13:47.294
<i>"Ipse tribuite virtutem
et fortitudinem plebi suae.</i>

00:13:47.327 --> 00:13:50.006
<i>Benedictus deus. Gloria patri."</i>

00:14:25.882 --> 00:14:27.354
Dean: she's still alive.

00:14:27.387 --> 00:14:30.499
Call 911. Get some water and blankets.

00:14:33.613 --> 00:14:36.423
Thank you.

00:14:36.457 --> 00:14:39.102
Shh, shh, just take it easy, all right?

00:14:39.135 --> 00:14:40.306
Thank you.

00:14:40.340 --> 00:14:41.410
Shh.

00:14:41.443 --> 00:14:43.151
Come on. Let's get her down.

00:14:45.360 --> 00:14:48.839
Sorry, sorry.

00:14:48.874 --> 00:14:51.550
I've got you. I've got you.

00:14:51.583 --> 00:14:53.491
It's okay. It's okay.

00:14:53.525 --> 00:14:57.341
A year.

00:14:57.374 --> 00:14:58.879
What?

00:14:58.914 --> 00:15:00.887
It's been a year.

00:15:00.922 --> 00:15:03.198
Just take it easy.

00:15:03.231 --> 00:15:07.046
I've been awake for some of it.

00:15:10.694 --> 00:15:13.371
I couldn't move my own body.

00:15:14.978 --> 00:15:20.131
The things i did
- It's a nightmare.

00:15:20.165 --> 00:15:22.809
Was it telling us the
truth about our dad?

00:15:22.842 --> 00:15:24.649
Dean.

00:15:24.682 --> 00:15:25.887
We need to know.

00:15:25.921 --> 00:15:27.494
Yes.

00:15:29.234 --> 00:15:35.426
But it wants... you to know

00:15:35.459 --> 00:15:39.375
That...they want you to come for him.

00:15:39.408 --> 00:15:42.354
If dad's still alive,
none of that matters.

00:15:53.866 --> 00:15:55.874
Where is the demon we're looking for?

00:15:55.907 --> 00:15:57.714
Not there.

00:15:57.747 --> 00:16:01.898
Other ones.

00:16:01.931 --> 00:16:03.471
Awful ones.

00:16:04.609 --> 00:16:06.583
Where are they keeping our dad?

00:16:06.617 --> 00:16:11.202
By the r-River.

00:16:14.915 --> 00:16:17.259
Sunrise.

00:16:17.293 --> 00:16:19.602
"Sunrise"? What does that mean?

00:16:21.710 --> 00:16:24.053
What does that mean?

00:16:58.242 --> 00:16:58.844
You better hurry up and beat it

00:16:59.614 --> 00:17:01.288
Before the paramedics get here.

00:17:01.321 --> 00:17:02.826
What are you gonna tell them?

00:17:02.860 --> 00:17:05.838
You think you guys
invented lying to the cops?

00:17:05.872 --> 00:17:08.483
I'll figure something out.

00:17:08.517 --> 00:17:11.829
Here. Take this. You might need it.

00:17:11.862 --> 00:17:13.637
Thanks.

00:17:14.874 --> 00:17:18.121
Thanks...for everything.

00:17:18.154 --> 00:17:19.594
Be careful, all right?

00:17:19.628 --> 00:17:21.066
Just go find your dad.

00:17:21.100 --> 00:17:24.346
And when you do, you bring
him around, would you?

00:17:24.380 --> 00:17:26.689
I won't even try to shoot him this time.

00:17:59.687 --> 00:18:01.695
You've been quiet.

00:18:03.637 --> 00:18:05.812
Just getting ready.

00:18:09.192 --> 00:18:12.204
He's gonna be fine, dean.

00:18:31.246 --> 00:18:33.722
Dude, what are you drawing on my car?

00:18:33.757 --> 00:18:36.734
It's called a devil's trap.

00:18:36.769 --> 00:18:39.077
Demons can't get
through it or inside it.

00:18:39.110 --> 00:18:40.449
So?

00:18:40.482 --> 00:18:43.830
It basically turns the
trunk into a lockbox.

00:18:45.838 --> 00:18:47.645
So?

00:18:47.678 --> 00:18:50.657
So we have a place to hide
the colt while we go get dad.

00:18:50.690 --> 00:18:53.501
What are you talking about?
We're bringing the colt with us.

00:18:53.534 --> 00:18:54.841
We can't, dean.

00:18:54.874 --> 00:18:56.614
We've only got three bullets left.

00:18:56.648 --> 00:18:58.488
We can't just use them on any demon.

00:18:58.521 --> 00:19:00.161
<i>We've got to use them on the demon.</i>

00:19:00.194 --> 00:19:02.302
No, we have to save dad, sam, okay?

00:19:02.336 --> 00:19:04.746
We're gonna need all
the help we can get.

00:19:04.780 --> 00:19:07.356
You know how pissed dad would
be if we used all the bullets?

00:19:07.390 --> 00:19:09.532
Dean, he wouldn't want
us to bring the gun.

00:19:09.565 --> 00:19:10.938
I don't care, sam!

00:19:10.971 --> 00:19:12.544
I don't care what dad wants, okay?

00:19:12.577 --> 00:19:14.384
Since when do you care what dad wants?

00:19:14.418 --> 00:19:17.096
We want to kill this demon.
You used to want that, too.

00:19:17.129 --> 00:19:19.605
Hell, you're the one who
came and got me at school!

00:19:19.638 --> 00:19:21.446
You're the one who dragged me into this.

00:19:21.480 --> 00:19:23.221
I'm just trying to finish it.

00:19:28.508 --> 00:19:31.185
Well, you and dad are a lot
more alike than i thought.

00:19:31.218 --> 00:19:33.862
You both can't wait to sacrifice
yourself for this thing.

00:19:33.896 --> 00:19:36.808
But you know what? I'm
gonna be the one to bury you.

00:19:41.192 --> 00:19:42.664
You're selfish, you know that?

00:19:42.697 --> 00:19:45.006
You don't care about
anything but revenge.

00:19:45.041 --> 00:19:47.014
That's not true, dean.

00:19:47.049 --> 00:19:48.989
I want dad back,

00:19:49.022 --> 00:19:51.165
But they are expecting
us to bring this gun.

00:19:51.198 --> 00:19:53.506
They get the gun, they will kill us all.

00:19:53.540 --> 00:19:56.353
That colt is our only
leverage, and you know it, dean.

00:19:56.385 --> 00:19:59.966
We cannot bring that gun. We can't.

00:20:00.000 --> 00:20:01.840
Fine.

00:20:01.874 --> 00:20:04.450
I'm serious, dean. I said "fine," sam.

00:20:34.670 --> 00:20:36.980
Hey, hey.

00:20:37.014 --> 00:20:41.866
I think i know what
meg meant by "sunrise."

00:20:51.438 --> 00:20:54.885
Son of a bitch. That's pretty smart.

00:20:54.918 --> 00:20:56.725
If these demons can possess people,

00:20:56.758 --> 00:20:58.901
They can possess almost anybody inside.

00:20:58.934 --> 00:21:01.411
And make anybody attack us.

00:21:01.445 --> 00:21:02.749
And so we can't kill 'em -

00:21:02.782 --> 00:21:05.160
A building full of human shields.

00:21:05.193 --> 00:21:07.970
They probably know exactly
what we look like, too,

00:21:08.004 --> 00:21:09.945
And they could look like anybody.

00:21:09.978 --> 00:21:11.653
This sucks out loud.

00:21:11.685 --> 00:21:16.772
All right, so, how the
hell are we gonna get in?

00:21:18.110 --> 00:21:22.562
Pull the fire alarm, get
out all the civilians.

00:21:22.596 --> 00:21:24.570
But then the city
responds in seven minutes.

00:21:24.604 --> 00:21:26.678
Seven minutes, exactly.

00:22:28.793 --> 00:22:30.265
You okay?

00:22:35.520 --> 00:22:37.158
Hey, what's happening? Is it a fire?

00:22:37.192 --> 00:22:39.001
We're figuring that out right now, sir.

00:22:39.033 --> 00:22:40.506
Just stay back.

00:22:40.540 --> 00:22:43.017
I got a yorkie upstairs, and
he pees when he's nervous.

00:22:43.049 --> 00:22:46.798
Sir, you have to stay back.

00:23:06.442 --> 00:23:09.121
I always wanted to be a
fireman when i grew up.

00:23:09.153 --> 00:23:11.294
You never told me that.

00:23:35.324 --> 00:23:38.838
This is the fire department.
We need you to evacuate.

00:24:08.389 --> 00:24:09.794
Hurry up!

00:24:45.102 --> 00:24:46.509
Dad.

00:24:53.537 --> 00:24:55.778
He's still breathing.

00:24:55.812 --> 00:24:57.986
Dad, wake up.

00:24:58.020 --> 00:24:59.293
Dad!

00:25:02.573 --> 00:25:03.877
Wait. Wait.

00:25:03.910 --> 00:25:05.048
What?

00:25:05.082 --> 00:25:07.124
He could be possessed, for all we know.

00:25:07.157 --> 00:25:09.901
What, are you nuts?

00:25:09.934 --> 00:25:11.708
Dean, we got to be sure.

00:25:33.495 --> 00:25:36.172
Sam?

00:25:38.849 --> 00:25:41.694
Why are you splashing water on me?

00:25:43.434 --> 00:25:46.145
Dad, are you okay?

00:25:46.178 --> 00:25:49.693
They've been drugging me.

00:25:49.726 --> 00:25:51.366
Where's the colt?

00:25:51.400 --> 00:25:54.244
Don't worry, dad, it's safe.

00:25:55.850 --> 00:25:59.465
Good, boys. Good, boys.

00:26:19.042 --> 00:26:20.516
Hey, buddy, you can't go in.

00:26:34.337 --> 00:26:35.308
Go!

00:26:35.341 --> 00:26:36.312
Back, back!

00:26:36.345 --> 00:26:38.353
Go!

00:26:45.027 --> 00:26:47.570
Sam, let's go!

00:27:05.743 --> 00:27:07.584
Sam!

00:27:41.585 --> 00:27:43.225
Sam!

00:27:43.259 --> 00:27:46.505
Sam, come on. Come on.

00:27:55.473 --> 00:27:57.113
Come on.

00:27:57.147 --> 00:27:59.356
Come on, we've got to get out of here.

00:28:39.248 --> 00:28:40.721
How is he?

00:28:40.755 --> 00:28:43.397
He just needed a
little rest, that's all.

00:28:43.432 --> 00:28:46.409
How are you?

00:28:46.444 --> 00:28:51.296
[ Inhales deeply ] i'll survive.

00:28:53.437 --> 00:28:56.416
Hey, you don't think we
were followed here, do you?

00:28:56.449 --> 00:28:58.090
I don't know. I don't think so.

00:28:58.124 --> 00:28:59.161
We couldn't have found

00:28:59.195 --> 00:29:01.069
A more out-Of-The-Way
place to hole up.

00:29:01.102 --> 00:29:03.645
Yeah.

00:29:07.661 --> 00:29:09.336
Hey, uh...

00:29:11.979 --> 00:29:13.953
Dean, you, um...

00:29:16.865 --> 00:29:19.844
You saved my life back there.

00:29:19.877 --> 00:29:23.491
So i guess you're glad
i brought the gun, huh?

00:29:23.524 --> 00:29:27.675
Man, i'm trying to thank you here.

00:29:29.917 --> 00:29:32.092
You're welcome.

00:29:43.103 --> 00:29:44.575
Hey, sam?

00:29:44.608 --> 00:29:46.583
Yeah?

00:29:46.616 --> 00:29:49.763
You know that guy i shot?

00:29:49.796 --> 00:29:52.139
There was a person in there.

00:29:57.059 --> 00:29:59.536
You didn't have a choice, dean.

00:29:59.568 --> 00:30:02.881
I know. That's not what bothers me.

00:30:02.915 --> 00:30:06.429
Then what does?

00:30:10.546 --> 00:30:13.223
Killing that guy, killing meg.

00:30:15.231 --> 00:30:18.578
I didn't hesitate. I didn't even flinch.

00:30:21.188 --> 00:30:24.167
For you or dad, the things
i'm willing to do or kill,

00:30:24.200 --> 00:30:26.208
It's just...

00:30:28.551 --> 00:30:31.396
It scares me sometimes.

00:30:37.921 --> 00:30:41.569
It shouldn't.

00:30:41.603 --> 00:30:43.276
You did good.

00:30:43.309 --> 00:30:45.652
You're not mad?

00:30:45.686 --> 00:30:48.263
For what?

00:30:48.296 --> 00:30:50.605
Using a bullet.

00:30:52.412 --> 00:30:55.859
Mad? I'm proud of you.

00:30:57.500 --> 00:31:02.084
You know, sam and i, we
can get pretty obsessed.

00:31:02.117 --> 00:31:07.237
But you
- You watch out for this family.

00:31:07.272 --> 00:31:09.413
You always have.

00:31:15.872 --> 00:31:17.177
Thanks.

00:31:29.192 --> 00:31:32.137
It found us. It's here. The demon?

00:31:32.171 --> 00:31:34.614
Sam, lines of salt in front
of every window, ever door.

00:31:34.648 --> 00:31:35.952
Already did it.

00:31:35.985 --> 00:31:38.429
Check it, okay?

00:31:38.463 --> 00:31:40.772
Dean, you got the gun? Yeah.

00:31:40.805 --> 00:31:42.780
Give it to me. Sam
tried to shoot the demon.

00:31:42.813 --> 00:31:44.620
It vanished.

00:31:44.654 --> 00:31:48.938
I won't miss. Now, the gun. Hurry.

00:31:52.585 --> 00:31:55.128
Son, please.

00:32:02.056 --> 00:32:04.700
Give me the gun. What
are you doing, dean?

00:32:04.734 --> 00:32:06.273
You'd be furious.

00:32:06.307 --> 00:32:07.277
What?

00:32:07.311 --> 00:32:08.683
That i wasted a bullet.

00:32:08.716 --> 00:32:11.695
He wouldn't be proud of
me. He'd tear me a new one.

00:32:18.689 --> 00:32:21.467
You're not my dad.

00:32:24.780 --> 00:32:27.090
I know my dad better than anyone,

00:32:27.123 --> 00:32:28.930
And you ain't him.

00:32:28.963 --> 00:32:30.537
What the hell has gotten into you?

00:32:30.569 --> 00:32:32.711
I could ask you the same thing.

00:32:32.745 --> 00:32:35.891
Dean? What the hell is going on?

00:32:35.925 --> 00:32:37.899
Your brother's lost his mind.

00:32:37.933 --> 00:32:39.070
He's not dad.

00:32:39.104 --> 00:32:40.242
What?

00:32:40.275 --> 00:32:41.481
I think he's possessed.

00:32:41.514 --> 00:32:43.755
I think he's been possessed
since we rescued him.

00:32:43.789 --> 00:32:45.797
Don't listen to him.
Dean, how do you know?

00:32:45.830 --> 00:32:47.303
He's different.

00:32:47.337 --> 00:32:48.542
We don't have time for this.

00:32:48.575 --> 00:32:50.850
Sam, if you want to kill this demon,

00:32:50.884 --> 00:32:52.691
You've got to trust me.

00:32:57.578 --> 00:32:59.685
Sam?

00:33:06.814 --> 00:33:08.488
No.

00:33:10.429 --> 00:33:11.601
No.

00:33:21.306 --> 00:33:22.645
Fine.

00:33:24.385 --> 00:33:29.438
You're both so sure. Go ahead.

00:33:30.910 --> 00:33:33.821
Kill me.

00:33:46.506 --> 00:33:49.183
I thought so.

00:34:02.503 --> 00:34:08.326
What a pain in the
ass this thing's been.

00:34:08.359 --> 00:34:12.007
It's you, isn't it?

00:34:12.041 --> 00:34:15.421
We've been looking for
you for a long time.

00:34:15.454 --> 00:34:17.194
Well, you found me.

00:34:17.228 --> 00:34:18.634
But the holy water?

00:34:18.667 --> 00:34:22.114
You think something like that
works on something like me?

00:34:27.234 --> 00:34:28.875
I'm gonna kill you!

00:34:28.909 --> 00:34:32.891
Oh, that would be a neat trick.

00:34:32.925 --> 00:34:36.069
In fact, here.

00:34:36.103 --> 00:34:40.521
Make the gun float to
you there, psychic boy.

00:34:49.457 --> 00:34:51.129
Well, this is fun.

00:34:51.163 --> 00:34:55.313
I could've killed you a
hundred times today, but this...

00:34:57.589 --> 00:34:59.463
This is worth the wait.

00:35:02.676 --> 00:35:08.566
Your dad
- He's in here with me,

00:35:08.599 --> 00:35:10.909
Trapped inside his own meat suit.

00:35:10.942 --> 00:35:13.318
He says "hi," by the way.

00:35:13.351 --> 00:35:15.460
He's gonna tear you apart.

00:35:18.472 --> 00:35:20.213
He's gonna taste the iron in your blood.

00:35:20.245 --> 00:35:22.387
Let him go, or i swear to god -

00:35:22.421 --> 00:35:27.241
What? What are you and god gonna do?

00:35:27.273 --> 00:35:32.026
You see, as far as i'm
concerned, this is justice.

00:35:36.343 --> 00:35:40.995
You know that little exorcism of yours?

00:35:41.029 --> 00:35:43.907
That was my daughter.

00:35:43.941 --> 00:35:45.246
Who, meg?

00:35:45.279 --> 00:35:46.953
The one in the alley?

00:35:49.061 --> 00:35:51.705
That was my boy.

00:35:51.738 --> 00:35:53.211
You understand?

00:35:53.245 --> 00:35:55.186
You've got to be kidding me.

00:35:55.219 --> 00:35:58.030
What? You're the only one
that can have a family?

00:35:58.063 --> 00:36:01.577
You destroyed my children.

00:36:01.610 --> 00:36:04.355
How would you feel if
i killed your family?

00:36:09.843 --> 00:36:13.325
Oh, that's right.

00:36:13.358 --> 00:36:15.366
I forgot. I did.

00:36:17.674 --> 00:36:22.694
Still, two wrongs don't make a right.

00:36:22.728 --> 00:36:25.205
You son of a bitch.

00:36:25.238 --> 00:36:28.786
I want to know why. Why did you do it?

00:36:28.819 --> 00:36:32.401
You mean why did i kill
mommy and pretty, little jess?

00:36:32.434 --> 00:36:33.605
Yeah.

00:36:33.638 --> 00:36:36.784
You know, i never told you this,

00:36:36.818 --> 00:36:40.165
But sam was gonna ask her to marry him.

00:36:40.198 --> 00:36:44.013
Been shopping for rings and everything.

00:36:44.046 --> 00:36:47.226
You want to know why?

00:36:47.259 --> 00:36:49.402
Because they got in the way.

00:36:49.435 --> 00:36:50.974
In the way of what?

00:36:51.007 --> 00:36:52.481
My plans for you, sammy -

00:36:52.514 --> 00:36:56.931
You...and all the children like you.

00:36:56.965 --> 00:37:00.613
Listen, you mind just
getting this over with, huh?

00:37:00.645 --> 00:37:03.290
'Cause i really can't
stand the monologuing.

00:37:03.323 --> 00:37:06.803
Funny, but that's all part
of your m.O., isn't it?

00:37:06.837 --> 00:37:11.222
Mask all that nasty
pain, mask the truth.

00:37:11.255 --> 00:37:13.430
Oh, yeah? What's that?

00:37:13.464 --> 00:37:15.773
You know, you fight, and
you fight for this family,

00:37:15.806 --> 00:37:21.027
But the truth is they don't need you.

00:37:21.061 --> 00:37:23.337
Not like you need them.

00:37:25.378 --> 00:37:29.427
Sam
- He's clearly john's favorite.

00:37:29.461 --> 00:37:32.004
Even when they fight,

00:37:32.038 --> 00:37:35.318
It's more concern than
he's ever shown you.

00:37:37.459 --> 00:37:41.442
I bet you're real proud
of your kids, too, huh?

00:37:41.475 --> 00:37:46.294
Oh, wait, i forgot. I wasted 'em.

00:38:00.049 --> 00:38:01.489
Aah!

00:38:01.522 --> 00:38:04.065
Dean!

00:38:04.098 --> 00:38:05.739
No!

00:38:12.734 --> 00:38:15.277
Dad!

00:38:15.310 --> 00:38:18.355
Dad, don't you let it kill me!

00:38:19.961 --> 00:38:21.602
Dean!

00:38:35.122 --> 00:38:37.264
Dad, please.

00:38:45.162 --> 00:38:46.602
Dean!

00:38:48.810 --> 00:38:51.554
No! Stop.

00:38:53.328 --> 00:38:55.169
Stop it.

00:39:03.001 --> 00:39:06.882
You kill me, you kill daddy.

00:39:06.916 --> 00:39:08.522
I know.

00:39:18.998 --> 00:39:21.976
Dean? Dean? Hey.

00:39:22.010 --> 00:39:23.482
Oh, god, you lost a lot of blood.

00:39:23.515 --> 00:39:25.657
Where's dad?

00:39:25.690 --> 00:39:27.799
He's right here. He's right here, dean.

00:39:27.833 --> 00:39:32.317
Go check on him.

00:39:40.550 --> 00:39:44.699
Dad?

00:39:44.733 --> 00:39:47.042
Sammy!

00:39:47.076 --> 00:39:50.790
It's still alive. It's
inside me. I can feel it.

00:39:50.824 --> 00:39:51.962
You shoot me.

00:39:51.995 --> 00:39:55.475
You shoot me! You shoot
me in the heart, son!

00:39:55.509 --> 00:39:58.053
Do it, now!

00:39:58.086 --> 00:39:59.894
Sam, don't you do it. Don't you do it.

00:39:59.927 --> 00:40:01.333
You've got to hurry.

00:40:01.365 --> 00:40:03.274
I can't hold on to it much longer.

00:40:03.307 --> 00:40:06.453
You shoot me, son! Shoot me!

00:40:06.486 --> 00:40:09.699
Son, i'm begging you! We
can end this here and now!

00:40:10.870 --> 00:40:13.514
Sammy, you kill me!

00:40:13.547 --> 00:40:14.686
Sam, no.

00:40:14.719 --> 00:40:17.429
You do this!

00:40:17.463 --> 00:40:20.007
Sammy!

00:40:20.041 --> 00:40:23.387
Sam, sam...

00:40:27.437 --> 00:40:29.378
I'm begging you, son. You've got to.

00:40:29.411 --> 00:40:32.457
I can't hold on to it much longer.

00:40:32.489 --> 00:40:34.365
Shoot me!

00:41:00.435 --> 00:41:03.916
Look, just hold on, all right?

00:41:03.949 --> 00:41:07.295
The hospital is only 10 minutes away.

00:41:07.328 --> 00:41:11.077
I'm surprised at you, sammy.
Why didn't you kill it?

00:41:11.111 --> 00:41:13.420
I thought we saw
eye-To-Eye on this.

00:41:13.453 --> 00:41:14.993
Killing this demon comes first -

00:41:15.026 --> 00:41:17.704
Before me, before everything.

00:41:20.280 --> 00:41:24.196
No, sir, not before everything.

00:41:24.230 --> 00:41:27.408
Look, we've still got the colt.

00:41:27.441 --> 00:41:29.082
We still have the one bullet left.

00:41:29.116 --> 00:41:30.923
We just have to start over, all right?

00:41:30.956 --> 00:41:32.296
We already found the demon -

00:00:00.932 --> 00:00:02.438
<font color="#ffff00" size=14>www.tvsubtitles.net</font>
